                                "sense_id": "3e474b25-4ac8-32c4-a18b-f8f9a5bfbd51",
                                "text": "The gap between feather-assisted running and feather-assisted flying seemed evolutionarily unbridgeable. But now again the notion of ground-travel aerodynamics is being given some careful thought."
                            }
